 you have multiple mods for range expansion, then reroll only the value of the mod. It is a fun way to reflect one's individuality in one's equipment.<br>\u3000The maximum value of mods is increased by craft level. The crafting level is increased by the resources spent on rerolling, so the more you reroll, the better equipment you will get. This is why it is \u201cInfinite\u201d.<br><br><strong>Overwhelming volume of enemies<strong><br>\u3000As in some balloon game, when a higher level rock is destroyed, a lower level rock appears. That lower level rock will cause even lower level rocks to appear. ...... Anyway, destroy a lot of enemies!</strong></strong></strong></strong>",
